 response←request ReturnUsageDataFiles fullPath;filename
⍝ Returns a usage data file from the log folder; `fullPath` starts with "usage-data/".
⍝ Anything but a usage data file - the application log next to them, a path - gets the same 404
⍝ as a file that does not exist; see `IsUsageDataFilename`.
 filename←{⍵↓⍨⌊/⍵⍳'/\'}fullPath
 :If IsUsageDataFilename filename
     response←request ReturnFiles(∊P.LogFolder),filename
 :Else
     response←request Respond 404
     response.Content←'File not found'
 :EndIf
